{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "右", "id": "右"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "好", "id": "好"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "師", "id": "師"}, {"form": "朝", "id": "朝"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "當", "id": "當"}, {"form": "罪", "id": "罪"}, {"form": "聽", "id": "聽"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "責", "id": "責"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "子", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.330755969960742, "source": "子", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 3.1780538303479458, "source": "子", "target": "責"}, {"weight": 0.5154660033224929, "source": "人", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 0.7667804316033989, "source": "人", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 1.6140782919906025, "source": "人", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 1.8787708462176849, "source": "朝", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.57191802677763, "source": "言", "target": "聽"}, {"weight": 1.7246201663904266, "source": "言", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 2.9773831348857946, "source": "言", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 0.780158557549575, "source": "言", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.8787708462176849, "source": "言", "target": "好"}, {"weight": 2.2842359543258492, "source": "言", "target": "右"}, {"weight": 2.4665575111198037, "source": "言", "target": "師"}, {"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "大", "target": "罪"}, {"weight": 3.1780538303479458, "source": "大", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.2617630984737906, "source": "大", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.2617630984737906, "source": "大", "target": "當"}, {"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "大", "t